          "cont": [],
          "key": "description",
          "lead": [],
          "value": "\"The `bsc session` CLI (#architect-starts-and-stops-system-sessions): start · stop · list the app-owned SYSTEM SESSIONS (designer, librarian, architect, sound-designer, integrator). The id is an ENUM resolved against a closed registry and refused outside it — that closed set is what makes the verb safe to grant to the architect, which ingests raw user prose. Tauri-free; rides the shared bsc-appchan transport.\""
        }
